# cloud-container-audit Rule

1. Follow `.agents/skills/cloud-container-audit/references/cloud_container_checklist.md` (CC-001 to CC-015, CC-V-*), `metadata_endpoints.md`, and `iam_privesc.md`.
2. List cloud hosts in the program's scope.txt, then run `.agents/skills/cloud-container-audit/scripts/cloud_exposure_check.py --target PROGRAM`.
3. Read-only status and version requests only. Never read metadata credentials, use found keys, exec into containers, or write to storage or queues.
